---
title: 15 - Transcript Review Sequence Diagram
---
sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant UI as TurnEditor / SpeakersDialog
 participant API as FastAPI
 participant Store as JobStore
 participant DB as SQLite
 participant Disk as Original minutes.json
 UI->>API: PATCH /api/jobs/{id}/turns/{turn_id}<br/>{text, speaker_id, speaker_name, reviewed, expected_revision}
 API->>Store: edit(job_id, turn_id, update)
 Store->>Disk: Load original minutes to validate turn / speaker
 Disk-->>Store: Original turn IDs and speaker IDs
 Store->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE / check expected_revision
 alt Revision mismatch
  DB-->>Store: Current revision differs
  Store-->>API: RevisionConflict
  API-->>UI: HTTP 409 reload message
 else Revision matches
  Store->>DB: Upsert edits, speaker_assignments and/or speakers
  alt Review-only / no content change
   Store->>DB: Advance summary_revision only if summary was current
  else Text, speaker assignment or display name changed
   Store->>DB: Keep old summary_revision
  end
  Store->>DB: Increment revision / append edit_events / commit
  Store->>Store: result(): read snapshot + original JSON<br/>apply overlays / derive stale / resolve evidence
  Store-->>API: Current ResultView
  API-->>UI: HTTP 200 edited view
 end
 Note over Store,Disk: Edits do not overwrite original minutes.json.
 Note over UI,DB: UI sends expected_revision / PATCH schema allows omission.<br/>Speaker merge requires expected_revision in the API schema.
